{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"metadata":{"platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"tvOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"watchOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"11.0","beta":false}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","title":"OUDSButton","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSButton"}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents10OUDSButtonV","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSButton"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" proposes layout with text only, icon only or text with icon."}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/init(icon:accessibilityLabel:flipIcon:appearance:style:action:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/init(text:appearance:style:action:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/init(text:icon:flipIcon:appearance:style:action:)"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/body"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true},{"anchor":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/Appearance","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/Style"],"title":"Enumerations","generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/View-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsbutton"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSButton","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Layouts","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Actions"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Appearances","anchor":"Appearances","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Five appearances are proposed for all layouts:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default (by default)"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Default buttons are used for actions which are not mandatory or essential for the user."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"strong"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Should be singular and prominent, limited to one per view."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It should be reserved for the most critical action, such as “Next,” “Save,” “Submit,” etc. It is a “call for action”."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"brand","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A brand primary color alternative to the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" button."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To be used sparingly for high-value specific actions or to visually anchor a brand moment. Do not use it as the default primary button in your interfaces."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A button with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSButton.Appearance.Brand"},{"type":"text","text":" appearance is not allowed as a direct or indirect child of an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSColoredSurface"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"minimal"}]},{"text":": Minimal buttons are commonly used for actions that are considered less crucial. They can be used independently or together with a strong button.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"negative","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Negative buttons should be used sparingly to warn of a destructive action,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for example, delete or remove, typically resulting in the opening of a confirmation dialog."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A button with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSButton.Appearance.Negative"},{"type":"text","text":" appearance is not allowed as a direct or indirect child of an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSColoredSurface"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading","text":"Code samples","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Icon only with default appearance","    OUDSButton(icon: Image(\"ic_heart\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Like\", appearance: .default) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","    \/\/ Or simpler","    OUDSButton(icon: Image(\"ic_heart\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Like\") { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ Text only with negative appearance","    OUDSButton(text: \"Delete\", appearance: .negative,  style: .default) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","    \/\/ Or simpler","    OUDSButton(text: \"Delete\", appearance: .negative) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ A loading button","    OUDSButton(text: \"Delete\", style: .loading) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ Text and icon with strong appearance","    OUDSButton(text: \"Validate\", icon: Image(\"ic_heart\"), appearance: .strong) { \/* the action to process *\/ }"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you need to flip your icon depending to the layout direction or not (e.g. if RTL mode lose semantics  \/ meanings):","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    @Environment(\\.layoutDirection) var layoutDirection","","    OUDSButton(text: \"Button\",","               icon: Image(systemName: \"figure.handball\"),","               flipIcon: layoutDirection == .rightToLeft)"]},{"text":"Styles","anchor":"Styles","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two style are available:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"default (by default)","type":"text"}]},{"text":": used in the normal usage of button. The aspect of the button changes for  states ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"disabled"}]},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"pressed","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"hovered","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" or normal (i.e. "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"enabled"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"loading"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": used after button was clicked and probably data are requested before navigate to a next screen or get updated data.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"anchor":"Rounded-layout","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Rounded layout"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Buttons can have rounded layouts to be favored in more emotional, immersive contexts or those tied to specific visual identities.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"For standard or business-oriented journeys, keep the default corners.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This evolution addresses the need for flexibility in adapting the design to some brand contexts."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To activate the rounded button behavior, set to true the "},{"code":"hasRoundedButtons","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" values of the "},{"code":"Tuning","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" object"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in your theme configuration (if the theme exposes this property at init)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Some themes do not have this flexibility like "},{"code":"SoshTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"WireframeTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"anchor":"Colored-surface","type":"heading","text":"Colored surface","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If button is placed on colored surface using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSColoredSurface"},{"type":"text","text":", the default colors (content, background and border) are automatically adjusted to switch to monochrome mode."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Remark: Today it is not allowed to place a Negative nor a Brand button on a colored surface."}],"type":"strong"}]},{"anchor":"Specific-behavior","type":"heading","text":"Specific behavior","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For accessibility reasons, if the system settings for reducing motion is enabled, the loading indicator does not move.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For ecodesign reasons, if the device is in low power mode, the loading indicator does not move."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Design documentation","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Design-documentation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-button"}]},{"text":"Themes rendering","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Themes-rendering"},{"anchor":"Orange","type":"heading","text":"Orange","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_button_Orange"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Orange-Business-Tools","type":"heading","text":"Orange Business Tools","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_button_OrangeBusinessTools"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Sosh","type":"heading","text":"Sosh","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_button_Sosh"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Wireframe","type":"heading","text":"Wireframe","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_button_Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Version","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"3.2.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside"},{"name":"Since","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"0.10.0","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside"}]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"r